msgstr "ກະລຸນາກຳນົດຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສອງໂນດ."

#. No need to check integrity since it will disabled when configuring
#: src/include/drbd/resource_conf.rb:800
msgid "Enter the node name:"
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ໂນດ:"

